4: ## 1. High-Risk Services & Flows
5: In a polyglot (written in more than 1 language) microservices system like the OpenTelemetry Astronomy Shop, risks are amplified by network boundaries, serial blocking execution paths, and asynchronous eventual consistency. Our codebase inspection has identified the following three high-risk microservices and workflows.
